  "body": "Second slice of #1250: a reference page for the **Milling 3D** kinds.\n\nFork synced at v0.18.0 (cut from upstream/main 37482923).\n\n## What changed\n- New `site/content/guide/operations-3d.md`, same structure and tone as the 2D page in #1260: per kind, what it is for and when to choose it over a neighbour, key settings by tab with seed defaults, picks, common refusals; plus a short section on how each kind is judged on a reduced-fidelity model.\n- `site/content/guide/operations.md`: one line linking the new page, placed apart from #1260's own link line so the two PRs merge in either order.\n- `posting.md` / `refusals.md` weights 5->6 and 6->7: the identical change #1260 makes, so it merges cleanly beside it. The 3D page takes weight 5; once #1260 merges, the 2D and 3D pages share weight 5 (both before Posting).\n\nStandalone: #1260 is not merged. `git merge-tree` of this branch with `issue/1250-docs-op-reference` is clean.\n\n## Kinds covered (from `KindInfo::ALL`, `Section::Mill3D`) and sources\n- **3D Pocket** - `seed_pocket3d` (`crates/app/src/operation/kinds.rs`), `seed.rs` (shared feeds/heights), UI `crates/ui/src/egui_app/mill3d_page.rs`, `lead_page.rs`, `Links::ROUGH3D`; refusals from `crates/motion/src/machining3d/{params,ladder}.rs` and `operation/generate.rs`.\n- **3D Finish** - `seed_finish3d`, `mill3d_page.rs` (pattern list `FINISH_PATTERNS` and hints), refusals from `crates/motion/src/finishing3d/*` and `generate.rs`.\n- **Deburr** - `seed_deburr`, `mill2d_more_page.rs` (Deburr arm), `op_tabs.rs` (no Passes / Leads tab), `types/area.rs` (no area), refusals from `generate.rs` and `finishing3d`.\n- Picks: `material_region::selection_drives_region`, `material_source.rs` (silhouette region), `types/area.rs`, `boundary_summary.rs`.\n- Reduced fidelity: `operation/fidelity_law.rs` (`excess_aware`), `model_fidelity.rs` (messages), stated only as the source states it.\n\n## How tested\nDocs only. `zola` is not installed on this machine, so `zola check` was not run; internal links use the same `@/guide/...` form as the existing pages and point at files that exist (`operations.md`, `refusals.md`, `operations-3d.md`).\n\n## Not done / left for later slices\n- No toolpath pictures (as with #1260).\n- Remaining families: multi-axis, turning, probing, plasma, wire/sinker EDM (once shipped).\n\nEffort: high (docs slice; no escalation)\n\nChangelog: none\n\nRefs #1250\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
